#! nimbus: desktop-recommends
# =============================================================================
# 15-firmware.list.chroot - firmware and CPU microcode (recommended)
# =============================================================================
# What: device firmware and microcode from non-free-firmware.
# Why:  spec section 1 (Apps row). The image needs it to support common
#       hardware, but a given machine may not, and removing for example
#       firmware-iwlwifi on a machine without Intel Wi-Fi must not take
#       nimbusos-desktop with it. So the metapackage Recommends these
#       (marker line above; docs/PLAN.md NOTE-48). firmware-intel-graphics
#       carries the Intel GPU firmware that Trixie split out of
#       firmware-misc-nonfree.
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

firmware-linux
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-intel-graphics
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-sof-signed
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
